621
00:49:46.960 --> 00:49:48.879
It's really a very funny story.

622
00:49:49.960 --> 00:49:51.879
His name was Ryess -

623
00:49:51.920 --> 00:49:54.559
R-Y-E-S-S. Ryess.

624
00:49:57.560 --> 00:49:59.479
